age could not be found.\"}]}]]}]}]],[]],\"forbidden\":\"$undefined\",\"unauthorized\":\"$undefined\"}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"33:I[55169,[\"/_next/static/chunks/ff1a16fafef87110.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/73350e696300078d.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/3a4fb10029fc91d1.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/2166b7d4a87176d4.js\"],\"TOCProvider\"]\n34:I[769,[\"/_next/static/chunks/ff1a16fafef87110.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/73350e696300078d.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/3a4fb10029fc91d1.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/2166b7d4a87176d4.js\"],\"Sidebar\"]\n35:I[47486,[\"/_next/static/chunks/ff1a16fafef87110.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/73350e696300078d.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/3a4fb10029fc91d1.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/2166b7d4a87176d4.js\"],\"ClientWrapper\"]\n36:T9cc,"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"# The Anoma Protocol Adapter\n\n## What is the Anoma Protocol Adapter?\n\nThe Anoma Protocol Adapter (PA) implements the Anoma DOS on an existing blockchain (L1s, L2s, etc.). It enables users, developers, and applications to access the Anoma Resource Machine (ARM) and all its features \n**without making any changes**. This deployment also allows the upcoming Anoma applications, such as [AnomaPay](https://x.com/anomapay), to simply work on the base chain.\n\nDive deeper into the PA:\n- [PA \u0026 ARM on Ethereum post on Ethresear.ch](https://ethresear.ch/t/the-anoma-protocol-adapter-is-live-on-ethereum/23466?ref=docs.anoma.net)\n- [Implementation of the EVM PA](https://github.com/anoma/evm-protocol-adapter?ref=docs.anoma.net)\n- [“The EVM Protocol Adapter: Bringing Intent-Centric Apps to Ethereum” at Anoma Research Day](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rKFZsOw360U)\n\n## Deployments\nThe Anoma PA is currently live on the following mainnets:\n\n- [Ethereum](https://x.com/anoma/status/1990798499563385222?s=20) ([contract](https://etherscan.io/address/0x46E622226F93Ed52C584F3f66135CD06AF01c86c#code), [tx](https://etherscan.io/tx/0x3a0999f4f67e6c7ef7a22cb19f3b458b497fa29f69a653f776e77194c415a024))\n- [Arbitrum](https://x.com/anoma/status/1995523551018008777?s=20) ([contract](https://arbiscan.io/address/0x6d0a05e3535bd4d2c32aad37ffb28fd0e1e528c3#code), [tx](https://arbiscan.io/address/0x6d0a05e3535bd4d2c32aad37ffb28fd0e1e528c3#code))\n- [Base](https://x.com/anoma/status/1998776484714987854?s=20) ([contract](https://basescan.org/address/0x6d0A05E3535bd4D2C32AaD37FFB28fd0E1e528c3#code), [tx](https://basescan.org/tx/0xd742878a2ca7deb2bacbe86bcf8c903c4cb683f8512e5fdd0e97b6ba99d24f68))\n- [Optimism](https://x.com/anoma/status/2019802605023609207?s=20) ([contract](https://optimistic.etherscan.io/address/0x094FCC095323080e71a037b2B1e3519c07dd84F8), [tx](https://optimistic.etherscan.io/tx/0xa763c3f9f66545503d4bd10d41bc9f8ed80aee5ed2fac22f58742fa0d90103ef))\n\nDozens of additional deployments are planned, follow [@anoma on X](https://basescan.org/tx/0xd742878a2ca7deb2bacbe86bcf8c903c4cb683f8512e5fdd0e97b6ba99d24f68) to stay up-to-date.\n\nYou can also use the [Anoma Explorer](http://explorer.anoma.net/) to view live Protocol Adapter deployments and explore indexed transactions across all deployed Protocol Adapters.\n\n## How to deploy your own PA?\nDevelopers who are interested in deploying the Anoma PA can follow this [README](https://github.com/anoma/evm-protocol-adapter/blob/main/README.md#deployment)."])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"5:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"x:mx-auto x:flex x:max-w-(--nextra-content-width)\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L33\",null,{\"value\":[{\"value\":\"What is the Anoma Protocol Adapter?\",\"id\":\"what-is-the-anoma-protocol-adapter\",\"depth\":2},{\"value\":\"Deployments\",\"id\":\"deployments\",\"depth\":2},{\"value\":\"How to deploy your own PA?\",\"id\":\"how-to-deploy-your-own-pa\",\"depth\":2}],\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L34\",null,{}],[\"$\",\"$L35\",null,{\"metadata\":\"$2:props:children:1:props:children:props:children:props:children:2:props:pageMap:4:frontMatter\",\"bottomContent\":\"